{"Setup", "初始设置"},
{"Welcome to {}", "欢迎使用 {}"},
{"{} plays {} from your own copy of the game. It needs the disc image of the game's "
 "PSP disc, {}, as an .iso file: the PlayStation 3 release carries it.",
 "{} 可以用你自己持有的游戏运行《{}》。它需要这款游戏 PSP 光盘（{}）的光盘镜像，即一个 .iso 文件：PlayStation 3 版中就带有这个镜像。"},
{"Choose the image next, in Android's file picker. {} copies it into its own storage (an "
 "app cannot keep reading a file elsewhere), checks that it is the right release and prepares "
 "the game from it. The copy needs as much free space as the image takes; once it is made, the "
 "original can be deleted. Nothing is downloaded.",
 "接下来请在 Android 的文件选择器中选择镜像。{} 会把它复制到自己的存储空间中（应用无法持续读取其他位置的文件），检查它是否为正确的版本，并据此准备游戏。复制所需的可用空间与镜像大小相同；复制完成后即可删除原文件。整个过程不会下载任何内容。"},
{"Choose the image next. {} checks that it is the right release, prepares the game from it "
 "and, unless you choose otherwise, copies it into its data folder so the game keeps working if "
 "the original is moved or deleted. Nothing is downloaded.",
 "接下来请选择镜像。{} 会检查它是否为正确的版本并据此准备游戏；除非你另行选择，它还会把镜像复制到自己的数据文件夹，这样即使原文件被移动或删除，游戏也能继续运行。整个过程不会下载任何内容。"},
